{"text":"What I feared most for myself at your age was not poverty but failure. At your age, in spite of a distinct lack of motivation at university where I had spent far too long in the coffee bar writing stories and far too little time at lectures, I had a knack for passing examinations and that for years had been the measure of success in my life and that of my peers. Now I am not dull enough to suppose that because you are young, gifted and well educated you have never known heartbreak, hardship or heartache. Talent and intelligence never yet inoculated anyone against the caprice of the fates and I do not for a moment suppose that everyone here has enjoyed an existence of unruffled privilege and contentment.","words":[{"text":"What","start":0.0,"end":1.06},{"text":"I","start":1.06,"end":1.32},{"text":"feared","start":1.32,"end":1.7},{"text":"most","start":1.7,"end":2.02},{"text":"for","start":2.02,"end":2.26},{"text":"myself","start":2.26,"end":2.6},{"text":"at","start":2.6,"end":2.84},{"text":"your","start":2.84,"end":3.04},{"text":"age","start":3.04,"end":3.4},{"text":"was","start":3.4,"end":4.0},{"text":"not","start":4.0,"end":4.22},{"text":"poverty","start":4.22,"end":4.8},{"text":"but","start":4.8,"end":5.54},{"text":"failure","start":5.54,"end":6.06,"punct":"."},{"text":"At","start":7.28,"end":7.5},{"text":"your","start":7.5,"end":7.76},{"text":"age","start":7.76,"end":8.16,"punct":","},{"text":"in","start":8.72,"end":8.9},{"text":"spite","start":8.9,"end":9.16},{"text":"of","start":9.16,"end":9.36},{"text":"a","start":9.36,"end":9.46},{"text":"distinct","start":9.46,"end":9.8},{"text":"lack","start":9.8,"end":10.14},{"text":"of","start":10.14,"end":10.36},{"text":"motivation","start":10.36,"end":10.82},{"text":"at","start":10.82,"end":11.08},{"text":"university","start":11.08,"end":11.56},{"text":"where","start":11.56,"end":12.4},{"text":"I","start":12.4,"end":12.58},{"text":"had","start":12.58,"end":12.76},{"text":"spent","start":12.76,"end":13.06},{"tex